sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant DC as Decision chat
    participant Ctx as DecisionContext
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Model as Main model
    participant Agents as Subagents
    participant Tool as ResearchTool
    participant NLM as NotebookLM MCP
    participant Agg as Result Aggregator

    User->>DC: States the problem

    loop Until the problem is defined
        DC->>User: Asks / requests a decision
        User->>DC: Answers
    end

    DC->>Ctx: Produces DecisionContext
    Ctx->>Orch: Hands over context
    Orch->>Model: Requests a plan
    Model->>Orch: Returns task plan
    Orch->>Agents: Delegates tasks
    Agents->>Tool: query / discover
    Tool->>NLM: chat_start / research_start
    NLM-->>Tool: task_id
    loop Poll until completed
        Tool->>NLM: chat_status / research_status
        NLM-->>Tool: pending | completed
    end
    Tool-->>Agents: Result + references
    Agents-->>Agg: Deliver results
    Agg-->>Orch: Aggregated results
    Orch->>Model: Requests synthesis
    Model-->>Orch: Final answer
    Orch-->>User: Presents result
